<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-Jurys year pre-tax profits rise 45 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Jurys year pre-tax profits rise 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.9		   vs 18.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.65		   vs 4.0</p>
<p> Total dividend	   7.25		   vs 6.3</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    13.82		  vs 9.51</p>
<p> Turnover		   57.72		  vs 49.33</p>
<p> Operating profit	 14.10		  vs 10.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company names is Jurys Hotel Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
